{
  "//": "Quote arithmetic, worked by hand. Read by packages/core/src/bom/quote.test.ts and by apps/api/tests/test_quote_math.py, so the TypeScript and the Python implementation cannot drift. Money is integer cents; rates are basis points; a quantity in sqft is in hundredths of a square foot.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "markup, discount and tax in that order",
